# Polylang PHPUnit

Extend `PLL_UnitTestCase` (`tests/phpunit/includes/testcase.php`) or a closer base in `includes/`. Languages, posts, and terms go through `self::factory()`.

```php
self::factory()->language->create( array( 'locale' => 'fr_FR' ) );
self::factory()->post->create( array( 'lang' => 'fr' ) );
```
